The desktop projection backend links to the OCCT shared libraries installed on
the user's system. The user can replace them with interface-compatible builds.

The optional local WASI build uses the OCCT 8.0.1 port and single-threaded
header from OCCTSwift (also LGPL 2.1). The kernel build, sources and patches
are identified at https://github.com/SecondMouseAU/OCCTSwift/tree/v4.0.0-kernel.8
